      "shortDescription": "Over the years, Bhaktivedanta Hospital & Research Institute has been privileged to touch the lives of millions, serving with compassion, care, and devotion. Our mission wouldn’t have been possible without the blessings of all the ISKCON leaders, Sadh",
      "bannerImage": "https://ohaokdfkdafgpwccauos.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/services-images/iskcon-devotees-healthcare-services/banner-iskcon-devotees-healthcare-services.png",
      "thumbnailImage": "https://ohaokdfkdafgpwccauos.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/services-images/iskcon-devotees-healthcare-services/banner-iskcon-devotees-healthcare-services.png",
      "slug": "/iskcon-devotees-healthcare-services",
