          "id": "t1",
          "title": "Overview",
          "type": "rich_text",
          "content": "<div class=\"row mt-5\"><div class=\"col-lg-7 col-md-7 pe-5\"><p class=\"param-fw\" id=\"if8x\"><span id=\"i0gpa\">The Department of Palliative Care at Bhaktivedanta Hospital & Research Institute was incepted in 2007. Since then, it has provided services to more than 2000 families in the Mumbai vicinity - including Mira Road, Bhayander, suburbs of North Mumbai, Thane, Vasai-Virar, and more.</span></p><p class=\"param-fw\">Our palliative staff is dedicated to <b class=\"text-color-second\">provide holistic healthcare to support to critically ill patients and their families physically, emotionally, mentally and spiritually.</b> We offer inpatient and outpatient services to needy patients and families.</p><p class=\"param-fw\" id=\"iiz0x\"><span id=\"iro8v\">For bedridden patients, we had provisions for visiting and providing palliative care at their homes.</span> Such patients can register for our Home Care Program at an affordable range. The team of Palliative Care serves as per the needs of the patients and not on the patient’s prognosis.</p></div><div class=\"col-lg-5 col-md-5 pr-5\"><div class=\"pc_wrap_icons dkshow\"><div class=\"pc_kk_dflx\"><img src=\"/images/p_care/icon1.png\" alt=\"icons\"/><h4>Home Visit</h4></div><div class=\"pc_kk_dflx\"><img src=\"/images/p_care/icon2.png\" alt=\"icons\"/><h4>Palliative Care at their doorstep</h4></div><div class=\"pc_kk_dflx\"><img src=\"/images/p_care/icon3.png\" alt=\"icons\"/><h4>Helping patients in their final journey</h4></div></div></div></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t             \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"accord-title phshow\" phtab2')\">Services\r\n        \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon-chevron-up accord-icon\" id=\"icon2\"></i>\r\n        \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>",
