          "title": "Overview",
          "type": "rich_text",
          "content": "<div class=\"content-wrap\" style=\"padding: 0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"container clearfix\">\r\n\t\t\t   \r\n\t\t\t   \r\n\t<div class=\"col-12 mb-4 d-sm-none d-md-block\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"row \">\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-11\" style=\"width:85%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"center border-bottom-0\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"abttitle\" style=\"margin-left: 8%;\">Swaasthya : The Organic Shop </h1>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"col-md-1 dkshow d-sm-none d-md-block\" style=\"width:15%; float: right;\">\n\t\n<i class=\"sharethis-inline-share-buttons i-circled\"></i>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t <div class=\"col-12 mb-4 d-sm-flex d-sm-block d-md-none\">\r\n        <div class=\"row mt-3\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-lg-10\" style=\"width:81%\">\r\n                <div class=\"center border-bottom-0\">\r\n                    <h1 class=\"second-font mt-2 font-mob-title\"><div class=\"font-mob-title-con\">Swaasthya : The Organic Shop </div></h1>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        \n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-1 d-md-none\" style=\"width:15%; float:right\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"bi bi-three-dots dropdown-toggle\"  aria-haspopup=\"true\" aria-expanded=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\">\n  <path d=\"M3 9.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 1 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 0 3zm5 0a1.5 1.5 0 1 1 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 0 3zm5 0a1.5 1.5 0 1 1 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 0 3z\"/>\n</svg>\n<div class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"sharethis-inline-share-buttons\" href=\"#\"><b>Share</b></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n        </div>\r\n        \r\n        </div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n                                   <div class=\"row\">\r\n                     <div class=\"col-md-12 mt-4 mb-4 dkshow\"><img src=\"https://pub-a3f5d293f21c42ebb873059f3d9e05a3.r2.dev/upload/banner/16689509302885.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"img-responsive ec_cus_w100\"></div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                                                    <div class=\"row\">\r\n                     <div class=\"col-md-12 mt-4 mb-4 phshow\"><img src=\"https://pub-a3f5d293f21c42ebb873059f3d9e05a3.r2.dev/upload/banner/16689509307304.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"img-responsive ec_cus_w100\"></div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                                   \r\n                  \r\n                 <div class=\"row os_sec_1_wrap\"><div id=\"i0mu\" class=\"col-lg-7 col-md-7 pe-5\"><h1 class=\"os_h1\">Overview</h1><p id=\"id74\">Bhaktivedanta Swaasthya Mission Statement - Bhaktivedanta Swaasthya is a social initiative to empower people to benefit from complete health of body, mind and soul and enabling them by providing products and services based on natural, scientific and traditional wisdom.</p><p id=\"ionb\"><span id=\"iz2b3n\">Swaasthya works on making lives healthier for the community around us. These days, the food we eat is full of harmful chemicals, preservatives and pesticides.</span> We make sure that we provide a complete range of products that are chemical and preservative free.</p></div><div id=\"ib79\" class=\"col-lg-5 col-md-5 pr-5\"><div class=\"pc_wrap_icons dkshow\"><div class=\"pc_kk_dflx\"><img src=\"/images/organic-shop/os_i1.png\" alt=\"icons\"/><h4>Providing products and services based on natural, scientific and traditional wisdom.</h4></div><div class=\"pc_kk_dflx\"><img src=\"/images/organic-shop/os_i2.png\" alt=\"icons\"/><h4 id=\"i7y7u\">Swaasthya works to make lives healthier</h4></div><div class=\"pc_kk_dflx\"><img src=\"/images/organic-shop/os_i3.png\" alt=\"icons\"/><h4>We provide a complete range of products that are chemical and preservative free.</h4></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row os_sec_2_wrap\"><div class=\"col-md-12\"><h1 class=\"os_h1\">Services</h1><p class=\"os_h1_sub mb0\">Swaasthya store offers more than 200 products produced naturally using age old traditional method. </p><p><strong>Let us have a look at the Swaasthya basket:</strong></p></div><div class=\"row points-nb pc_sline pc_sline_top\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><div class=\"ellipse\"><p>Organic Grains And Pulses</p></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><div class=\"ellipse\"><p>Desi Cow Ghee</p></div></div></div><div class=\"row points-nb pc_sline\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><div class=\"ellipse\"><p>Gir Cow Ghee</p></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><div class=\"ellipse\"><p>Stone Grinded Flours</p></div></div></div><div class=\"row points-nb pc_sline\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><div class=\"ellipse\"><p>Wood Churned Cold Pressed Oils</p></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><div class=\"ellipse\"><p>Farm Fresh Honey</p></div></div></div><div class=\"row points-nb pc_sline\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><div class=\"ellipse\"><p>Himalayan Pink Rock Salt.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><div class=\"ellipse\"><p>Traditionally Made Baby Foods</p></div></div></div><div class=\"row points-nb pc_sline pc_s_mb pc_s_mb70\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><div class=\"ellipse\"><p>Healthy Breakfast Porridge</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row os_sec_3_wrap\"><h1 class=\"os_h1\">Swaasthya Kitchen & Warehouse</h1><div class=\"row os_sec_3_wrap_inner\"><div class=\"col-md-12\"><ul class=\"os_sec_3_list\"><li id=\"ieoop\"><span id=\"ivf2la\">We strictly say no to all things refined, this includes salt, sugar, oils, and flour.</span></li><li id=\"ilxef\"><span id=\"i2j5sb\">We offer a wide range of ready-to-eat snacks and healthy breakfast porridges too.</span></li><li id=\"isllk\"><span id=\"i8zqrx\">All processed foods are produced using Desi Cow Ghee and stone-ground flour. We use rock candy sugar, jaggery, and honey as an alternative to refined sugar.</span></li><li id=\"ielz4\"><span id=\"i22c7k\">The warehouse has vacuum packing and sealing machines to ensure the products remain extra fresh.</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"row os_sec_4_wrap\"><div class=\"col-md-12\"><h1 class=\"os_h1\" id=\"i6ozh\">Empowering Initiative</h1></div><div class=\"col-md-7\"><ul class=\"os_ei\"><li id=\"in9qj\"><span id=\"i6vsfg\">Part of the Swaasthya Initiative proceeds go to support the Rural and Tribal upliftment.</span></li><li id=\"irdh73\"><span id=\"ik8tct\">We have donated a wood churning oil machine to young boys residing in a village near Nashik.</span></li><li id=\"ic568u\"><span id=\"i45pn1\">These boys are trained through the government-recognized training Institute at Nashik.</span></li><li id=\"i6f5qi\"><span id=\"i1wis5\">We have donated a wood churning oil machine to young boys residing in a village near Nashik.</span></li><li id=\"is5bdf\"><span id=\"iw4hfj\">All these oils are then sold in our outlets ensuring regular income generation for the village’s youth.</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"col-md-5 dkshow\"><div class=\"os_ei_img\" id=\"ijncpr\"><img src=\"/images/organic-shop/os_right_img.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"row os_sec_5_wrap\"><div class=\"col-md-12 text-center\"><h3 class=\"os_sec_5_head\">Timings:</h3><p class=\"os_sec_5_timing\">Monday to Saturday</p><p class=\"os_sec_5_timing\">09:00 am to 09:00 pm.</p><p>Closed on Sundays & Hospital Holidays.</p></div></div>\r\n               </div>\r\n\t\t</div>",
