      "shortDescription": "The Speech & Audiology Department at the Bhaktivedanta Hospital & Research Institute works in tandem with the Department of ENT. It is committed to provide exceptional services in diagnosis and treatment of all problems related to speech and hearing.",
      "bannerImage": "https://ohaokdfkdafgpwccauos.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/services-images/speech-audiology/banner-speech-audiology.jpg",
