      "shortDescription": "Share The Artificial Kidney Dialysis (AKD) unit at the Bhaktivedanta Hospital and Research Institute is well-equipped with technologically advanced dialysis equipment and state-of-the-art reverse osmosis plant for water purification. The unit caters ",
      "bannerImage": "https://ohaokdfkdafgpwccauos.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/services-images/dialysis-unit/banner-dialysis-unit.jpg",
      "thumbnailImage": "https://ohaokdfkdafgpwccauos.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/services-images/dialysis-unit/thumbnail-dialysis-unit.png",
      "slug": "/dialysis-unit",
