          "content": "<h2 class=\"abttitle text-left ph-subt mt-50\">Accurate Diagnosis leads to early detection…Early Detection save lives...</h2><p class=\"param-fw\" id=\"i7yd\">The department of Radiology at the Bhaktivedanta Hospital & Research Institute is one of the best diagnostic imaging services providers in Mira Road. <span id=\"iocum\">Our department is supported with the latest state-of-the-art equipment and trained radiologists round-the-clock to provide specialized care for the patient.</span></p><p class=\"param-fw\">We are well-equipped in the areas of CT, Ultrasound, Digital Subtraction Angiography (DSA), Mammography, X-Rays and intervention procedure to render accurate and trustworthy diagnosis for precise treatment.</p><p class=\"param-fw\">Our radiologists are highly skilled and fully integrated with the medical and surgical care to provide quality care to patients at the hospital. We offer radiology services in vascular, neuroradiology, abdominal, cardiac, chest, women’s imaging and many more.</p><p class=\"param-fw\">The radiology department at the hospital is a part of scientific research studies and clinical trials for enhancing patient treatment and care.</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t     \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    \r\n        \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"accord-title phshow\" phtab2')\">Services\r\n        \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon-chevron-up accord-icon\" id=\"icon2\"></i>\r\n        \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>",
